sequenceDiagram
    participant Cron as GitHub Actions
    participant GF as gmail_fetcher
    participant RB as run_briefing
    participant EF as email_filter
    participant SM as summarizer
    participant NC as notion_creator
    participant TG as telegram_briefer
    Cron->>GF: 07:30 觸發取信
    GF->>GF: Gmail OAuth2 抓今日信
    GF-->>RB: today_emails.json 預取快取
    Cron->>RB: 執行晨報流程
    RB->>EF: filter_emails 信件清單
    EF->>EF: L1 規則 + L2 Haiku 判斷
    EF-->>RB: 保留的信件
    loop 每封保留信件
        RB->>SM: summarize_email
        SM-->>RB: JSON 摘要
        RB->>NC: create_notion_task
        NC-->>RB: Notion 頁面 URL
    end
    RB->>TG: format_briefing + send
    TG-->>RB: 發送結果
